  "body": "**[Original report](https://bitbucket.org/agriggio/art/issues/228) by sevenzerotwo (Bitbucket: [sevenzerotwo](https://bitbucket.org/sevenzerotwo), GitHub: [sevenzerotwo](https://github.com/sevenzerotwo)).**\n\n----------------------------------------\n\nWhen i try to export my RAW \\(.CR2\\) to GIMP, it doesn’t open GIMP. Instead, when i inspecting the terminal, it outputs this when exporting:\n\n![](https://bitbucket.org/repo/9pArXyE/images/4286602298-Screenshot_20220111_112919.png)\n`gimp: symbol lookup error: /lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/libjson-glib-1.0.so.0: undefined symbol: g_objec`  \n`t_new_with_properties`\n\nAnd also, do you plan to make GIMP plugin to load RAWs through ART, just like RawTherapee plugin on GIMP?\n\nAnyway, i run ART from Kubuntu 21.10, with latest ART linux build from Downloads \\(ART 1.12\\), and GIMP version 2.10.24 from Kubuntu repositories.\n\nThank you!\n",
